WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
(suspenseful music)

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:09.948
- Today, we're about to
get our noses pierced.

00:00:09.948 --> 00:00:11.788
- I'm fucking psyched.

00:00:11.788 --> 00:00:12.655
I can't wait.

00:00:12.655 --> 00:00:15.423
I've wanted my nose pierced
since I was 14 years old.

00:00:15.423 --> 00:00:17.885
- I've always seen piercings

00:00:17.885 --> 00:00:20.411
as another form of self expression.

00:00:20.411 --> 00:00:22.789
- All in all I think piercings
are absolutely beautiful.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:26.501
- I told my mom about
my piercing last night

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:29.596
and she was just like, silent.

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.610
- Fucking scared, I hate needles,

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.972
so we better go do this
before I change my mind.

00:00:33.972 --> 00:00:37.760
(lighthearted music)

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.554
- I'm Brian Keith Thompson,
we're at Body Electric Tattoo

00:00:40.554 --> 00:00:44.362
and, actually, today is
my 10 year anniversary.

00:00:44.362 --> 00:00:47.863
What we're gonna do first
is clean your nostril,

00:00:47.863 --> 00:00:49.961
mark your nostril, pierce your nostril.

00:00:49.961 --> 00:00:52.677
Not gonna surprise you,
so don't be nervous.

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:55.544
We're gonna do this by the numbers, relax.

00:00:55.544 --> 00:00:57.957
Don't let your mind win, just relax.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.809
Okay, give me a big, giant deep breath,

00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:01.826
all the way in, all the way out.

00:01:01.826 --> 00:01:03.993
(exhales)

00:01:06.418 --> 00:01:08.668
Deep breath all the way in.

00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:12.845
(exhales)

00:01:12.845 --> 00:01:15.595
(dramatic music)

00:01:30.278 --> 00:01:31.278
- I love it!

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:35.376
Wow, this is crazy.

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:39.493
- Oh my God.

00:01:39.493 --> 00:01:40.802
- It look so good!

00:01:40.802 --> 00:01:41.885
- Oh, my God!

00:01:45.117 --> 00:01:47.200
(laughs)

00:01:49.766 --> 00:01:50.599
- Oh, yeah.

00:01:50.599 --> 00:01:51.432
- It's perfect.

00:01:51.432 --> 00:01:52.827
- That looks dope.

00:01:52.827 --> 00:01:55.471
- I love it so much
and it was so painless.

00:01:55.471 --> 00:01:58.292
- I'm really happy with it,
I think its really cute.

00:01:58.292 --> 00:02:00.211
- Soon as it finished, I
looked at myself in the mirror

00:02:00.211 --> 00:02:02.994
and I was like, oh, looks like
I've always had a nose ring.

00:02:02.994 --> 00:02:05.046
- If you're thinking
about getting a piercing

00:02:05.046 --> 00:02:07.937
and it actually means something to you

00:02:07.937 --> 00:02:09.695
then you should definitely go for it.

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:12.445
(dramatic music)

